{
  "name": "New Client Onboarding",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumption: incoming webhook payload shape\n\nThis workflow assumes the e-signature tool / CRM automation (e.g. PandaDoc, DocuSign, HelloSign) POSTs a JSON body shaped like:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"clientName\": \"Jane Doe\",\n  \"clientEmail\": \"jane@example.com\",\n  \"companyName\": \"Acme Inc\",\n  \"dealValue\": \"12000\",\n  \"proposalId\": \"PROP-1234\"\n}\n```\n\nThe real payload shape depends on which e-signature/CRM tool you use. If your tool nests these fields differently (e.g. under `data`, `document`, or a webhook envelope), update the **Normalize Client Data** node's expressions accordingly.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "affea69f-00aa-4d02-a184-4d839c69d68a",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Payload Assumption",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -180,
        -20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Placeholders to replace before use\n\n1. **Create Client Folder** node -> Parent Folder = `REPLACE_WITH_PARENT_FOLDER_ID`\n2. **Send Welcome Email** node -> onboarding doc links marked `REPLACE ME`\n3. **Create Onboarding Card** node -> List ID = `REPLACE_WITH_TRELLO_LIST_ID`\n4. **Announce New Client** node -> Channel = `REPLACE_WITH_CHANNEL` (suggested default: #new-clients)\n\nAlso attach your own Google Drive, Gmail, Trello, and Slack credentials to the respective nodes - none are pre-configured.\n\nNote: the Trello card link used in the Slack message assumes the Trello API response includes a `url` field on the created card (standard Trello REST API behavior).",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e9ea43c4-efa3-4335-a0b4-5979ef285150",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Placeholders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -180,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "proposal-signed",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "76db06a5-99da-44bb-a429-3440f3ec56f9",
      "name": "Proposal Signed Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        280,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "proposal-signed-onboarding"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "629243af-df43-4d65-969e-6227943469bf",
              "name": "clientName",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.clientName }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "8cf17aa2-ef64-405a-9fe5-ef0b5dd173d9",
              "name": "clientEmail",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.clientEmail }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "90e04a8e-c645-406c-a510-ca58c03b317b",
              "name": "companyName",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.companyName }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "ee7535bb-aaa8-453e-9734-947e55c48d8a",
              "name": "dealValue",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.dealValue }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "54c1eb17-a305-4b5a-af03-5e20ea6309ce",
              "name": "proposalId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.proposalId }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a10c08c3-787b-4ac0-a7c4-2cef852a940b",
      "name": "Normalize Client Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        500,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "folder",
        "operation": "create",
        "name": "={{ $json.companyName }} - Onboarding",
        "driveId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "My Drive",
          "cachedResultName": "My Drive"
        },
        "folderId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_PARENT_FOLDER_ID",
          "cachedResultName": "REPLACE_WITH_PARENT_FOLDER_ID (placeholder - select real folder in n8n UI)"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1d60f24f-2621-4589-998f-b14faf77a68a",
      "name": "Create Client Folder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Normalize Client Data').item.json.clientEmail }}",
        "subject": "=Welcome aboard, {{ $('Normalize Client Data').item.json.clientName }}!",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<p>Hi {{ $('Normalize Client Data').item.json.clientName }},</p>\n<p>Welcome to <strong>{{ $('Normalize Client Data').item.json.companyName }}</strong> onboarding! We're excited to get started.</p>\n<p>Your dedicated onboarding folder is ready here: <a href=\"{{ $json.webViewLink }}\">{{ $json.webViewLink }}</a></p>\n<p>A few resources to help you get going:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://REPLACE-ME.example.com/getting-started\">Getting Started Guide (REPLACE ME)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://REPLACE-ME.example.com/kickoff-checklist\">Kickoff Checklist (REPLACE ME)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Talk soon,<br/>The Team</p>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "80f3c216-a7d2-4117-add5-c4657eedabf5",
      "name": "Send Welcome Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        940,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "apiKey",
        "resource": "card",
        "operation": "create",
        "listId": "REPLACE_WITH_TRELLO_LIST_ID",
        "name": "={{ $('Normalize Client Data').item.json.companyName }} - Onboarding",
        "description": "=New client onboarding task.\n\nProposal ID: {{ $('Normalize Client Data').item.json.proposalId }}\nDeal Value: {{ $('Normalize Client Data').item.json.dealValue }}\nOnboarding folder: {{ $('Create Client Folder').item.json.webViewLink }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "7aab3d47-1d61-447e-9c17-92683b1ec847",
      "name": "Create Onboarding Card",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.trello",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1160,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "accessToken",
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_CHANNEL",
          "cachedResultName": "REPLACE_WITH_CHANNEL (placeholder - default suggestion #new-clients)"
        },
        "messageType": "text",
        "text": "=:tada: New client onboarding started!\n\n*Company:* {{ $('Normalize Client Data').item.json.companyName }}\n*Deal Value:* {{ $('Normalize Client Data').item.json.dealValue }}\n*Onboarding folder:* {{ $('Create Client Folder').item.json.webViewLink }}\n*Trello card:* {{ $json.url }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "77d30356-b604-42e0-b802-aab2433ecb37",
      "name": "Announce New Client",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        1380,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Proposal Signed Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Normalize Client Data",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Normalize Client Data": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create Client Folder",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Create Client Folder": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Welcome Email",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Send Welcome Email": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create Onboarding Card",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Create Onboarding Card": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Announce New Client",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
